+No newly found presence-only closure/tolerance/label property meets the blocking predicate beyond Finding 1. `T:1460` actively rejects parser uncertainty; `T:1465-1466` checks equality with actual checker sets rather than presence. `T:1593-1605` compares imported checker values and parsed runner value. `T:697-714` tests both source shape and the checker summary behavior. Production anti-pattern screen was clean; test screen reported 11 documented source-shape/process-safety hits, none a new closure bypass.
